---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Help Center"
  description="Get help using Pixelquil's tools, find answers, troubleshooting tips, and how to reach us directly."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Help Center
    </span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">How can we help?</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-600">
      Most answers live in one of three places below. If you can't find what you need, reach out
      directly, every message gets read.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/faqs/" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-brand-300">
        <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 015 0c0 1.5-2 1.8-2 3.2M12 17v.01" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">General FAQs</h2>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500">Common questions about Pixelquil itself, privacy, pricing, and how tools work.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/svg-tools/" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-brand-300">
        <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 10-4.5-2-8-5-8-10V6z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Tool-specific help</h2>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500">Every tool page has its own FAQ and step-by-step "How it works" section built in.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/contact/" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-brand-300">
        <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
          <path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact us directly</h2>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500">Bug reports, tool suggestions, or anything not covered above.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Quick troubleshooting</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-brand-600">•</span>
          <span><strong class="text-slate-900">A tool isn't loading correctly:</strong> try refreshing the page, or clearing the specific tool with its Clear button before pasting new content.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-brand-600">•</span>
          <span><strong class="text-slate-900">Copy or download isn't working:</strong> some browser privacy settings block clipboard access, check for a permission prompt or try a different browser.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-brand-600">•</span>
          <span><strong class="text-slate-900">A tool gives an unexpected result:</strong> double check your input is valid, most tools include a validator or status panel that explains what's wrong.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>